# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
#  ⚠️  DO NOT PUT REAL KEYS IN THIS FILE — it is committed to GitHub (public!).
#  Paste keys on the dashboard's Connectors page (saved to the git-ignored `.env`),
#  or copy this file to `.env` and fill that one in.
#  Every provider below has a FREE tier. More keys = more free quota, because
#  AIVA's router spreads requests across all of them and fails over on limits.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# 1) Groq — fastest (LPU). Free: gpt-oss-120b / gpt-oss-20b / qwen3.8-27b,
#    each 30 RPM · 1K req/day · 8K tokens/min (cached tokens are free),
#    plus Whisper speech-to-text (2K req/day). REQUIRED for voice input.
#    Get it: https://console.groq.com/keys
GROQ_API_KEY=

# 2) Mistral — backup brain + speech-to-text backup. Free mode (measured Nov 2026):
#    ministral-14b / ministral-8b / open-mistral-nemo at 2 req/min EACH, 40K tokens/min;
#    Voxtral STT at 60 req/min. Bigger models need pay-as-you-go.
#    Get it: https://console.mistral.ai/api-keys
MISTRAL_API_KEY=

# 3) Google Gemini — extra backup (Flash-Lite ≈ 500 req/day on the free tier).
#    Get it: https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
GEMINI_API_KEY=

# 4) Sarvam AI — the most human Hinglish VOICE (Bulbul v4 Flash "companion" personas,
#    emotion-aware delivery). Free credits on sign-up. Without it AIVA uses free Edge voices.
#    Get it: https://dashboard.sarvam.ai
SARVAM_API_KEY=

# 5) Optional extras
#    Cerebras: $5 trial credit after adding a card (very fast qwen-3.8-27b).
CEREBRAS_API_KEY=
#    OpenRouter `:free` models: 20 req/min, 50 req/day (emergency fallback).
OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
